[00:00] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Neon is a serverless Postgres database built for the modern developer workflow. And in this video, I\'m going to walk you step-by-step through the process of getting started with Neon. I\'m going to show you how you can create your first database, how to connect your database'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'to an ORM like Drizzle. I\'ll show you how to define a schema and how you can create, read, update, and delete data. And we\'re going to be doing all of this with a little help from AI to streamline'

[00:24] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the process and get you up and running as quickly as possible. But don\'t worry, if you don\'t want to use a coding agent, I\'ll have all of the code from this video in a GitHub repo linked down in the description. And by the end of this'

[00:36] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'video, you\'ll have created this cool little to-do list app that comes fully equipped with confetti. So, if that sounds interesting, let\'s jump right in. Okay, so first things first, you\'re going to want to create a'

